{#
Parameter:
- is_dashboard: boolean (true wenn im Dashboard, blendet "Aktueller Plan" ein)
- user_plan: string (z.B. 'starter' oder 'free')
#}
<section id="pricing" x-data="{ monthly: true }" class="{{ is_dashboard ? 'mt-12' : 'py-24 bg-white' }}">
    <div class="{{ is_dashboard ? 'w-full' : 'max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8' }}">

        {# Header Sektion #}
        <div class="{{ is_dashboard ? 'flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between mb-8 gap-4 bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm' : 'text-center mb-16' }}">
            <div>
                {% if is_dashboard %}
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Upgrade dein Abo</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Wähle den passenden Plan für ein höheres Kontingent.</p>
                {% else %}
                    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-indigo-600 uppercase tracking-widest">Preise</h2>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">Einfache, faire Preise.</p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            {# Einheitlicher Switcher #}
            <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center items-center">
                <div class="bg-gray-100 p-1 rounded-xl flex items-center shadow-inner">
                    <button @click="monthly = true"
                            :class="monthly ? 'bg-white text-gray-900 shadow-sm' : 'text-gray-500'"
                            class="px-6 py-2 text-sm font-bold rounded-lg transition-all">
                        Monatlich
                    </button>
                    <button @click="monthly = false"
                            :class="!monthly ? 'bg-white text-gray-900 shadow-sm' : 'text-gray-500'"
                            class="px-6 py-2 text-sm font-bold rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center">
                        Jährlich
                        <span class="ml-2 text-[10px] bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-md">-20%</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {# Cards Grid - Jetzt mit 3 Spalten auf Large Screens #}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 {{ is_dashboard ? '' : 'mb-24' }}">

            {# --- Starter Plan --- #}
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-8 flex flex-col transition-all {{ is_dashboard and user_plan == 'starter' ? 'ring-2 ring-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/10' : 'hover:shadow-xl' }}">
                <div class="flex-grow">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Starter</h3>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm">Ideal für Freelancer & kleine Automatisierungen.</p>
                        </div>
                        <template x-if="!monthly">
                            <span x-transition class="text-[10px] bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">36€ gespart</span>
                        </template>
                        {% if is_dashboard and user_plan == 'starter' %}
                            <span class="bg-indigo-600 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm">Aktuell</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline">
                        <span class="text-5xl font-black text-gray-900" x-text="monthly ? '14€' : '11€'">14€</span>
                        <span class="ml-1 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-400" x-text="monthly ? '/Monat' : '/Monat*'">/Monat</span>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
                        <li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            50 Dokumente / Monat inkl.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            100% GoBD-konform (ZUGFeRD & XRechnung)
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            30 Tage Archiv
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                {% if is_dashboard and user_plan == 'starter' %}
                    <button disabled class="mt-10 block w-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl text-center cursor-not-allowed">Bereits aktiv</button>
                {% else %}
                    {% if is_dashboard %}
                        <a :href="'{{ path('app_payment_plan', {plan: 'starter'}) }}' + (monthly ? '?cycle=monthly' : '?cycle=yearly')"
                           class="mt-10 block w-full bg-white border-2 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600 font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl text-center hover:bg-indigo-50 transition shadow-sm">
                            Plan wählen
                        </a>
                    {% else %}
                        <a href="{{ path('register') }}"
                           class="mt-10 block w-full bg-white border-2 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600 font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl text-center hover:bg-indigo-50 transition shadow-sm">
                            Jetzt starten
                        </a>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            {# --- Business Plan (Featured) --- #}
            <div class="relative bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-2 border-indigo-600 p-8 flex flex-col transition-all hover:shadow-indigo-100 {{ is_dashboard ? '' : 'lg:scale-105 z-10' }}">
                <div class="absolute top-3 right-0 -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-[-24px] flex justify-end">
                    <div class="inline-flex flex-row-reverse items-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide shadow-lg">
                        <span>Empfohlen</span>
                        <div x-show="!monthly" x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-300" x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 max-w-0" x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 max-w-[200px]" class="flex items-center overflow-hidden">
                            <span class="text-indigo-100 whitespace-nowrap">-120€ / Jahr</span>
                            <span class="mx-2 h-4 w-px bg-indigo-400/50"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex-grow">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Business</h3>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm">Für wachsende Plattformen & ERP-Systeme.</p>
                    <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline">
                        <span class="text-5xl font-black text-gray-900" x-text="monthly ? '49€' : '39€'">49€</span>
                        <span class="ml-1 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-500" x-text="monthly ? '/Monat' : '/Monat*'">/Monat</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm">
                        <li class="flex items-center text-gray-900 font-bold">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            500 Dokumente / Monat inkl.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center text-gray-600 italic">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-indigo-500 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            Multi-API-Keys für verschiedene Umgebungen
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center text-gray-600 italic">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-indigo-500 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            Archiv über 3 Jahre
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                {% if is_dashboard %}
                    <a :href="'{{ path('app_payment_plan', {plan: 'business'}) }}' + (monthly ? '?cycle=monthly' : '?cycle=yearly')"
                       class="mt-10 block w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl text-center hover:bg-indigo-700 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 transition">
                        Jetzt upgraden
                    </a>
                {% else %}
                    <a href="{{ path('register') }}"
                       class="mt-10 block w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl text-center hover:bg-indigo-700 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 transition">
                        Plan wählen
                    </a>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            {# --- Enterprise Plan --- #}
            <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-3xl shadow-sm p-8 flex flex-col transition-all hover:shadow-xl">
                <div class="flex-grow">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Enterprise</h3>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-400 text-sm">Maximale Performance & individuelle Integration.</p>

                    <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline">
                        <span class="text-4xl font-black text-white italic">Individuell</span>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
                        <li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-300">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-indigo-400 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            Individuelles Volumen (High-Traffic)
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-300">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-indigo-400 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            Custom SLA & Auftragsverarbeitungs-Vertrag (AVV)
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-300">
                            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-indigo-400 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            Priorisierter Entwickler-Support
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="mailto:support@fidufakt.de?subject=Enterprise%20Anfrage"
                   class="mt-10 block w-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl text-center hover:bg-white/20 transition">
                    Kontakt aufnehmen
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>

        {# Footer Info #}
        <p x-show="!monthly" class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-indigo-600 font-semibold italic">
            * Die jährliche Abrechnung spart dir bis zu 120€ pro Jahr!
        </p>

        {# FAQs nur auf der Landingpage anzeigen #}
        {% if not is_dashboard %}
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-16">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 text-center mb-12">Häufige Fragen zu FiduFakt</h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-8">
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center">
                            <span class="text-indigo-600 mr-2">Q:</span> Sind die Rechnungen rechtssicher?
                        </h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Ja. Unsere API generiert Dokumente nach dem europäischen Standard EN 16931. Damit erfüllen Sie alle Anforderungen für B2B-E-Rechnungen und Behörden (Leitweg-ID Unterstützung inkl.).</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center">
                            <span class="text-indigo-600 mr-2">Q:</span> Kann ich mein Abo jederzeit kündigen?
                        </h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Absolut. Bei monatlicher Abrechnung können Sie jederzeit zum Ende des Zeitraums kündigen. Keine Knebelverträge, volle Flexibilität.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center">
                            <span class="text-indigo-600 mr-2">Q:</span> Was passiert bei 2025 E-Rechnungspflicht?
                        </h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">FiduFakt ist bereits heute darauf ausgelegt. Mit unserer API wandeln Sie Ihre bestehenden Prozesse ohne großen Aufwand in ein rechtskonformes System um.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center">
                            <span class="text-indigo-600 mr-2">Q:</span> Wie erhalte ich meinen API-Key?
                        </h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Direkt nach der Registrierung können Sie in Ihrem Dashboard API-Keys für Test- und Live-Umgebungen erstellen und sofort loslegen.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</section>
